    Bug 2066254 - Remove dead code from nsSubscribableServer and subscribe UI plumbing. r=mkmelin

    - Remove nsISubscribableServer.startPopulatingWithUri() and
      nsIImapService.getListOfFoldersWithPath(); neither had any callers.
      This also removes the IMAP implementation StartPopulatingWithUri().
    - Remove the no-op Init() method and its "init_method" entry in
      components.conf.
    - Remove the write-only mServerType member.
    - Remove leftover declarations from the old XUL tree implementation
      (ConvertNameToUnichar, GetRow, AddSubtree) and the now-unneeded
      XULTreeElement/nsITreeSelection includes.
    - Remove the dead folderView getter in NntpIncomingServer.sys.mjs which
      always returned undefined.
    - Drop a vestigial NS_ENSURE_SUCCESS after CreateNode(), which cannot
      fail, and the unused rv in AddChildNode().
    - Update stale comments: the hostinfo.dat ordering rationale in
      AddChildNode() was inaccurate (the file preserves server order, not
      alphabetical order), and GetLeafName()'s "when we switch to using the
      tree" TODO referred to a migration that already happened.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321165

